    "human_label": "Implement"
  },
  {
    "index": 15,
    "sentence": "Therefore, substituting back in: 3[(n + 1/2)² - 1/4] + 7 = 3(n + 1/2)² - 3/4 + 7 = 3(n + 1/2)² + 25/4",
